Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: support AN7552 receive-only NPU firmware

Support the legacy receive-only firmware ABI while retaining host-managed
Ethernet PPE and the normal Wi-Fi transmit path.

---
diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
@@ -119,6 +119,8 @@
 };
 
